(6785479, 1017617, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like it - well seen.<br/>Funny how some people thought the title was controversial - but the song does what great art does: asks us to turn the world inside-out and consider how things could possibly be different  whether or not it is possible is all up to us.<br/>Personally I bet many military veterans and families would consider a world without the need for war a better world than the one we live in now.<br/> <br/>As with all great work - the photo and the context causes us to question something and truly imagine.</td>', 'I like it - well seen.Funny how some people thought the title was controversial - but the song does what great art does: asks us to turn the world inside-out and consider how things could possibly be different  whether or not it is possible is all up to us.Personally I bet many military veterans and families would consider a world without the need for war a better world than the one we live in now. As with all great work - the photo and the context causes us to question something and truly imagine.', '2012-06-04 08:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
