(6786101, 1017617, 97225, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top picks (gave you 9) and it never occurred to me to take it as promoting patriotism or nationalism (or communism???) I think a sea of flags honouring fallen soldiers is a superb fit with ''imagine ... nothing to kill or die for''. It is very sad and poignant and the sheer number of those flags emphasizes the waste and futility of war - and the almost inevitability of it which demands us to ''imagine if we can''. I''d like to imagine that John Lennon would have viewed this image in this light.</td>', 'This was one of my top picks (gave you 9) and it never occurred to me to take it as promoting patriotism or nationalism (or communism???) I think a sea of flags honouring fallen soldiers is a superb fit with ''imagine ... nothing to kill or die for''. It is very sad and poignant and the sheer number of those flags emphasizes the waste and futility of war - and the almost inevitability of it which demands us to ''imagine if we can''. I''d like to imagine that John Lennon would have viewed this image in this light.', '2012-06-04 23:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
