(6786208, 1017120, 34938, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> I appreciate you taking the time to make your comment to Margaret, but when I first saw it, I thought everything about it was imaginative. The title in particular works, and the idea of watering the ocean works. The image looks great and conveys a quirkiness that appeals to me. I think Margaret did a great job and deserved to win. Like everything, imagination is in the eye of the beholder. <br/> <br/>I like it a lot.<br/> <br/>Congratulations Margaret<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-05 04:16:24.</i></td>', ' ubique I appreciate you taking the time to make your comment to Margaret, but when I first saw it, I thought everything about it was imaginative. The title in particular works, and the idea of watering the ocean works. The image looks great and conveys a quirkiness that appeals to me. I think Margaret did a great job and deserved to win. Like everything, imagination is in the eye of the beholder.  I like it a lot. Congratulations Margaret', '2012-06-05 05:05:35.000000', '2012-06-05 05:16:24.000000', 0),
