(6793166, 1017120, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Breathtaking!  I certainly gasped when I saw it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Is this what our site has become? "Artistic criticism" is now considered "personal attacks"? I guess Paul''s mistake was treating you as an artist. His second mistake was thinking the SC allowed different views to be expressed. Clearly that''s not the case.</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Breathtaking!  I certainly gasped when I saw it.   Is this what our site has become? "Artistic criticism" is now considered "personal attacks"? I guess Paul''s mistake was treating you as an artist. His second mistake was thinking the SC allowed different views to be expressed. Clearly that''s not the case.', '2012-06-12 15:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6793199, 1017624, 65319, '<td valign="top">Okay...I know I''m supposed to be looking at the bird, but I just love that LAMP!  I want one!  Your notes are so funny!  Congrats, Wendy!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-12 16:39:08.</i></td>', 'Okay...I know I''m supposed to be looking at the bird, but I just love that LAMP!  I want one!  Your notes are so funny!  Congrats, Wendy!', '2012-06-12 16:15:35.000000', '2012-06-12 17:39:08.000000', 0),
