(7598231, 1017701, 61651, '<td valign="top">I love Monhegan and have been there often, and once on the trip back to the mainland experienced high swells like this that dwarfed the ferry and appeared nigh to topple us. Can accurately imagine what that pooch might have felt in the moment. Good angle choice in the composition here.</td>', 'I love Monhegan and have been there often, and once on the trip back to the mainland experienced high swells like this that dwarfed the ferry and appeared nigh to topple us. Can accurately imagine what that pooch might have felt in the moment. Good angle choice in the composition here.', '2018-10-06 00:16:01.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
